  "raw_meta_yaml": "schema_version: 1\n\ncontext:\n  name: open62541pp\n  version: \"0.21.3\"\n\npackage:\n  name: ${{ name }}\n  version: ${{ version }}\n\nsource:\n  url: https://github.com/open62541pp/open62541pp/archive/refs/tags/v${{ version }}.tar.gz\n  sha256: f841fd85f61976d624099ac82e7c12c07a1d0316b96d81be18ecf53433a1e041\n\nbuild:\n  number: 0\n\nrequirements:\n  build:\n    - ${{ compiler('cxx') }}\n    - ${{ stdlib('c') }}\n    - ninja\n    - cmake\n  host:\n    # open62541pp v0.21.3 is only tested/compatible up to open62541 v1.4.x\n    # (see .github/workflows/open62541-compatibility.yml upstream); 1.5\n    # changed async callback signatures and removed UA_Server_triggerEvent.\n    - open62541 >=1.4,<1.5\n  run_exports:\n    - ${{ pin_subpackage(name, upper_bound='x.x.x') }}\n\ntests:\n  - requirements:\n      run:\n        - cmake-package-check\n        - ${{ compiler('cxx') }}\n    script:\n      - if: not win\n        then:\n          - test -f ${PREFIX}/include/open62541pp/server.hpp\n          - test -f ${PREFIX}/lib/libopen62541pp${SHLIB_EXT}\n          - test -f ${PREFIX}/lib/cmake/open62541pp/open62541ppConfig.cmake\n        else:\n          - if not exist %PREFIX%\\\\Library\\\\include\\\\open62541pp\\\\server.hpp exit 1\n          - if not exist %PREFIX%\\\\Library\\\\bin\\\\open62541pp.dll exit 1\n          - if not exist %PREFIX%\\\\Library\\\\lib\\\\open62541pp.lib exit 1\n          - if not exist %PREFIX%\\\\Library\\\\lib\\\\cmake\\\\open62541pp\\\\open62541ppConfig.cmake exit 1\n      - cmake-package-check open62541pp\n\nabout:\n  license: MPL-2.0\n  license_file: LICENSE\n  summary: C++17 wrapper of open62541, an open source implementation of OPC UA (IEC 62541).\n  homepage: https://github.com/open62541pp/open62541pp\n  repository: https://github.com/open62541pp/open62541pp\n  documentation: https://open62541pp.github.io/open62541pp/\n\nextra:\n  recipe-maintainers:\n    - TomNysWF\n",
